---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`Privacy Policy for ${SITE_NAME}.`}
  path="/privacy-policy"
>
  <div class="wrapper" style="padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; max-width: 50rem;">
    <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated: August 17, 2026</strong></p>

    <p>
      {SITE_NAME} respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information may be
      collected when you visit this website and how that information is used.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE_NAME} is primarily an informational website. We do not require you to create an
      account or provide personal information simply to browse the site.
    </p>
    <p>
      Like most websites, basic technical information may be processed by our hosting and
      infrastructure providers when you access the site. This can include information such as
      your IP address, browser type, device information, referring page, and the date and time
      of a request. This information is generally used to operate, secure, and improve the site.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE_NAME} does not intentionally use cookies to identify individual visitors. Third-party
      services used to host, secure, measure, or deliver parts of the website may use cookies or
      similar technologies according to their own policies.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>Information that is available to us may be used to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Operate and maintain the website.</li>
      <li>Protect the website from abuse, fraud, and security threats.</li>
      <li>Understand general website usage and improve the site's content and performance.</li>
      <li>Comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      The website may rely on third-party providers for hosting, content delivery, analytics,
      embedded content, or other site functionality. Those providers may process information as
      described in their own privacy policies. We do not control the privacy practices of third
      parties.
    </p>

    <h2>Links to Other Websites</h2>
    <p>
      Our content may contain links to third-party websites. Once you leave {SITE_NAME}, the
      privacy practices of the destination website apply. We are not responsible for the privacy
      practices or content of third-party sites.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Retention and Security</h2>
    <p>
      We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes described
      in this policy, including security, operational, and legal purposes. No method of internet
      transmission or electronic storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute
      security.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE_NAME} is not directed toward children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect
      personal information from children under 13 through this website.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Privacy Rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on where you live, you may have rights regarding personal information, including
      rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict certain uses of your information. Requests
      are handled subject to applicable law and reasonable verification requirements.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this
      page with an updated effective date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how information is handled on {SITE_NAME},
      please use the contact information provided on the website.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
